y gates or the contract semantics.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"scope_and_limits\": {\n+    \"allowed_inputs_only\": true,\n+    \"historical_solver_answers_or_scores_read\": false,\n+    \"network_used\": false,\n+    \"solver_executed\": false,\n+    \"repository_or_tests_executed\": false,\n+    \"repository_or_contract_modified\": false,\n+    \"only_write\": \"native-expansion-prospective-v1/grading-contract-review.json\",\n+    \"prepared_json_needed_or_read\": false,\n+    \"limits\": [\n+      \"Static source review only; no runtime reproduction or empirical outcome validation.\",\n+      \"Full source inventory identity was not reconstructed; all cited source files and 46 exact line spans were hashed against the pinned rubric.\",\n+      \"The contract readiness_report_sha256 target, normalization provenance, post-fix corroboration and historical records were intentionally not opened; their contents are outside this review.\",\n+      \"Review certifies the exact contract input SHA listed above. A later freeze metadata update changes the whole-file hash and must be recorded separately; semantic changes require review.\"\n+    ]\n+  }\n+}"},{"sha":"12c5ae784e078ea44d4334182e12826b344e25c8","filename":"benchmarks/native-claude-qa-pilot/provenance/native-expansion-v1/native-expansion-grading-readiness-v1.json","status":"added","additions":936,"deletions":0,"changes":936,"blob_url":"https://github.com/Cuiyus/zvec-grep/blob/bbc15485ca317427f6b19cab4dc449c50d3ef731/benchmarks%2Fnative-claude-qa-pilot%2Fprovenance%2Fnative-expansion-v1%2Fnative-expansion-grading-readiness-v1.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/Cuiyus/zvec-grep/raw/bbc15485ca317427f6b19cab4dc449c50d3ef731/benchmarks%2Fnative-claude-qa-pilot%2Fprovenance%2Fnative-expansion-v1%2Fnative-expansion-grading-readiness-v1.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cuiyus/zvec-grep/contents/benchmarks%2Fnative-claude-qa-pilot%2Fprovenance%2Fnative-expansion-v1%2Fnative-expansion-grading-readiness-v1.json?