\": \"The documentation states a default-branch prerequisite, but the same fork currently has a registered active confirmation workflow absent from main and retains successful nondefault-branch push and workflow_dispatch runs. Do not infer from expansion 404 that changing main is mandatory. Historical default-ref changes were not independently reconstructed.\"\n+    },\n+    \"forced_default_branch_presence_demonstrated\": false,\n+    \"reason\": \"The expansion workflow is currently absent from registration and GET workflow returns 404. A manual dispatch has not been attempted. This observation alone does not establish a hard default-branch-file requirement.\"\n+  },\n+  \"rust_artifact\": {\n+    \"id\": 12176409568,\n+    \"run_id\": 39221698769,\n+    \"head_sha\": \"a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699\",\n+    \"name\": \"rust-native-linux-x64-gnu\",\n+    \"metadata_readable\": true,\n+    \"expired\": false,\n+    \"expires_at\": \"2026-11-02T09:34:56Z\",\n+    \"bytes\": 40061559,\n+    \"api_digest\": \"sha256:00873b7a5505bb4f628c5d33336c058750cb09dcccccc8ae2718fa8d0cfb0e03\",\n+    \"large_archive_downloaded\": false,\n+    \"archive_byte_readability_retested\": false\n+  },\n+  \"fresh_upstream_ls_remote\": {\n+    \"expected_sha\": \"a424e0ce06868dc9ad8f142f57de59b8f9b58699\",\n+    \"observed_stdout_file\": \"upstream-main-ls-remote.stdout\",\n+    \"command_metadata_file\": \"upstream-main-ls-remote.command.json\",\n+    \"returncode\": 0\n+  },\n+  \"proposed_resolution_only\": {\n+    \"preferred_proposal\": \"Review a minimal fork-only, target-branch and path-filtered push preflight for the new workflow, analogous to the already successful confirmation entry. Preserve paid execution and collection guards, the false default and frozen-input checks. After a separately authorized push preflight, verify workflow registration with read-only GET/list before considering any separately authorized dispatch.\",\n+    \"current_paid_step_guard\": \"github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch' && inputs.execute_expansion == true\",\n+    \"current_collect_step_guard\": \"always() && github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch' && inputs.execute_expansion == true\",\n+    \"execute_expansion_default\": \"false\",\n+    \"required_review_points\": [\n+      \"Restrict the push preflight to Cuiyus/zvec-grep, the intended development branch and narrowly relevant files.\",\n+      \"Verify no provider execution command runs on push; paid execution and collection remain conditional on workflow_dispatch and an explicit true input.\",\n+      \"Update and freeze the workflow SHA and associated plan pins before any execution; retain the preflight result and identity.\",\n+      \"Do not substitute the latest moving branch HEAD for a separately frozen execution head.\"\n+    ],\n+    \"default_main_change_required_by_current_evidence\": false,\n+    \"implemented\": false,\n+    \"fallback\": \"A separately reviewed default-branch registration change remains an alternative only if the fork push-registration approach fails; it has not been attempted or authorized here.\"\n+  },\n+  \"commands\": [\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"confirmation-dispatch-run\",\n+      \"argv\": [\n+        \"gh\",\n+        \"api\",\n+        \"repos/Cuiyus/zvec-grep/actions/runs/39343873279\"\n+      ],\n+      \"started_at_utc\": \"2026-10-20T01:19:47.054165+00:00\",\n+      \"finished_at_utc\": \"2026-10-20T01:19:48.375116+00:00\",\n+      \"returncode\": 0,\n+      \"stdout_file\": \"confirmation-dispatch-run.stdout\",\n+      \"stderr_file\": \"confirmation-dispatch-run.stderr\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"name\": \"confirmation-push-precheck-run\",\n+      \"argv\": [\n+        \"gh\",\n+        \"api\",\n+        \"repos/Cuiyus/zvec-grep/actions/runs/39343647059\"\n+      ],\n+      \"started_at_utc\": \"2026-10-20T01:19:47.053334+00:00\",\n+      \"finished_at_utc\": \"2026-10-20T01:19:48.637515+00:00\",\n+      \"returncode\": 0,\n+      \"stdout_fil